   <titleInfo>
      <title>Distinguished Lecture Series: Maggie Wilderotter, CEO of Frontier Communications</title>
   </titleInfo>
   <abstract>The Distinguished Lecture Series is an annual Fall Celebration Dinner that brings together advisory board members, alumni, students, faculty, and staff to celebrate the College of Business's recent achievements and to recognize outstanding business and community leadership. The highlight of the evening is the Lecture. In 2019, the Distinguished Lecture Series was renamed the Joe Albrecht Distinguished Lecture Series and was established through an endowment gift from the late Joe Albrecht, a member of the College of Business Board of Trustees for over 33 years, the Albrecht Lecture Series brings to campus business executives, government and thought leaders, authors, and entrepreneurs for an open exchange of ideas and current issues.</abstract>
